// layer-switch.ts

// "World | UI" (UI stage 1, 2026-10-19; design §2.3, §4): what the editor moves now — the game's world (3D / 2D
// objects) or its UI (HTML marked data-studio-key). Shown only when the bridge says the game has both layers
