//
//   State   Normal | Hover | Pressed | Disabled      (a button only: shows that look in the game)
//   Text    [Glow Garden      ][72 px] ↺           (its main text and that text's size; not for words mixed with a value)
//   Color   [■ #fff6d8]                ↺
