// ui-theme.ts

// "Theme" under the UI list (UI stage 3, studio-ui-edit-2, 2026-10-22; asked for as "change the theme's colours and
// fonts and the whole UI follows — fixing buttons one by one is too much"; CONTRACT.md §1.11).
